    "Health Connect" to "Health Connect",
    "Health Connect doesn't store a recovery score. Computed locally: HRV vs your 7-day baseline (50%), resting HR vs baseline (25%, lower is better), sleep score (25%). Requires at least 7 days of HRV/RHR history." to "Health Connectには回復スコアが保存されません。端末内で計算します。HRVを7日間の基準値と比較(50%)、安静時心拍を基準値と比較(25%、低いほど良好)、睡眠スコア(25%)で求めます。HRVと安静時心拍の履歴が7日以上必要です。",
    "Health Connect doesn't store a sleep score. Computed locally: 60% duration (best at 7–9h) + 40% efficiency." to "Health Connectには睡眠スコアがありません。端末内で計算します:睡眠時間60%(7〜9時間が最適)+効率40%。",
    "Health Connect not available." to "Health Connectは利用できません。",
    "Health Connect pulls health data from apps on your phone. If apps like MyFitnessPal, Cronometer, or Samsung Health share data with Health Connect, we can use it too.\n\nIf you wear a Fitbit, Samsung Watch, or another wearable we don't connect to directly, you can still bring its data in here: connect that wearable's own app to Health Connect, then Health Connect to MigraineMe." to "Health Connectは、スマートフォン内のアプリから健康データを取り込みます。MyFitnessPal、Cronometer、Samsung HealthなどのアプリがHealth Connectにデータを共有していれば、MigraineMeでも使えます。\n\nFitbit、Samsung Watch、または当アプリが直接つながらない他のウェアラブルをお使いの場合も、データを取り込めます。そのウェアラブルのアプリをHealth Connectに接続し、続けてHealth ConnectをMigraineMeに接続してください。",
    "Health Connect stores absolute body temperature. We compute deviation from your 7-day baseline (matches Whoop/Oura format). Requires at least 7 days of history; needs a compatible device." to "Health Connectには体温の実測値が保存されます。7日間の基準値からのずれを計算します(Whoop/Ouraと同じ形式)。7日以上の履歴と対応するデバイスが必要です。",
    "Health Connect wearables connected!" to "Health Connect対応のウェアラブルを接続しました!",
    "Health Connect, Oura, Polar, Garmin" to "Health Connect、Oura、Polar、Garmin",
    "Health Connect, WHOOP, Oura, Polar, Garmin" to "Health Connect, WHOOP, Oura, Polar, Garmin",
    "Health Connect: pulls health metrics from any app on your phone that's set up to share with it. If you log food in MyFitnessPal or Cronometer, sleep in Samsung Health, or activity from a Fitbit / Garmin / Wear OS watch through their official apps, all of that lands in MigraineMe through here.\n\n" to "Health Connect:共有を設定したスマートフォン内のあらゆるアプリから、健康指標を取り込みます。MyFitnessPalやCronometerで記録した食事、Samsung Healthの睡眠、Fitbit・Garmin・Wear OSの時計の活動データを各公式アプリ経由で取り込む場合も、すべてここを通してMigraineMeに反映されます。\n\n",
